    "markdown": "\n# Nutzereigenschaften\n\n## Setup\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(tidyverse)\nlibrary(lubridate)\nlibrary(gt)\nlibrary(visdat)\n# library(data.table)\n# library(collapse)\nlibrary(targets)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nsource(\"_common.r\")\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ntar_load(c(n_action_searches_interactions, data_prepped, time_spent))\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nn_actions_searches_interactions <-\n  data_prepped |>\n  select(\n    idvisit,\n    fingerprint,\n    any_of(c(\n      \"searches\",\n      \"actions\",\n      \"interactions\",\n      \"referrertype\",\n      \"referrername\",\n      \"language\",\n      \"devicetype\",\n      \"devicemodel\",\n      \"operatingsystem\",\n      \"browsername\"\n    ))\n  )\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Unique IDs, Fingerprints, Mean searches, Mean actions\n\nAuswertung \n- der Anzahlen der uniquen visitids und uniquen Fingerprints\n- Mittelwerte der Anzahl der Suchen und Aktionen pro Besuch\n\n### idivisit und fingerprint jeweils unique\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nn_actions_searches_interactions |>\n  as.data.frame() |>\n  summarise(\n    idvisit_n = length(unique(idvisit)),\n    fingerprint_n = length(unique(fingerprint)),\n    actions_mean = mean(as.integer(actions), na.rm = TRUE),\n    searches_mean = mean(as.integer(searches), na.rm = TRUE)\n  )\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"idvisit_n\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"fingerprint_n\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"actions_mean\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"searches_mean\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"14207\",\"2\":\"7160\",\"3\":\"153.0122\",\"4\":\"0.5026395\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n:::{.callout-note}\nEs gibt etwa doppelt so viele Besucher wie unique Nutzer.\n:::\n\n\n## Referrer Type pro Visit\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nn_actions_searches_interactions |>\n  count(referrertype, sort = TRUE)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"referrertype\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"n\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"website\",\"2\":\"9387\"},{\"1\":\"direct\",\"2\":\"4792\"},{\"1\":\"search\",\"2\":\"19\"},{\"1\":\"social\",\"2\":\"9\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n## Referrer Type Name pro Visit\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nn_actions_searches_interactions |>\n  count(referrername, sort = TRUE)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"referrername\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"n\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"elearning.ohmportal.de\",\"2\":\"7556\"},{\"1\":\"NA\",\"2\":\"4792\"},{\"1\":\"moodle.hswt.de\",\"2\":\"1242\"},{\"1\":\"moodle.thi.de\",\"2\":\"259\"},{\"1\":\"my.ohmportal.de\",\"2\":\"96\"},{\"1\":\"ohmportal.de\",\"2\":\"47\"},{\"1\":\"statics.teams.cdn.office.net\",\"2\":\"32\"},{\"1\":\"hans.th-nuernberg.de\",\"2\":\"23\"},{\"1\":\"moodle.didaktikzentrum.de\",\"2\":\"23\"},{\"1\":\"elarch.cs.ohmportal.de\",\"2\":\"21\"},{\"1\":\"moodle.hs-augsburg.de\",\"2\":\"14\"},{\"1\":\"Google\",\"2\":\"13\"},{\"1\":\"moodle.evhn.de\",